1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
One word for every feeling?

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:05,000
아이고! (aigo!)
Stubbed your toe? Aigo.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,500
아이고, 예뻐라! (aigo, yeppeora!)
Cute baby? Same word, softer.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,700
아이고 허리야 (aigo heoriya)
After thirty, it means "my back".

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:20,800
아이고, 끝났네 (aigo, kkeunnanne)
What's your aigo moment? 👇
